     "type": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Apartment interior design, custom furniture and turnkey renovation, 51 m²"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN (Bratislava, Slovakia)</strong> completed a project for a 51 m² apartment: interior design, technical documentation, custom furniture, a turnkey renovation, and decorating."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The design covers the living room, bedroom, kitchen with custom interior fittings and built-in appliances, walk-in closets, entrance hall, and bathroom; wardrobes, shelving, and storage systems are built into the interior."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The furniture for each area was designed around the room dimensions and the owners’ habits — at the same time as the interior — so storage is convenient and the space feels cohesive."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "Before work began, a detailed cost estimate was prepared for construction and finishing materials, furniture, and appliances. The studio managed the project from the concept through the renovation, furniture installation, and decorating."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The gallery features photorealistic 3D visualizations of the apartment."
      }
     ]
